hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16532","Yazid ibn Harun narrated to us, he said: Hajjaj ibn Artah narrated to us, from Amr ibn Shuayb, from Said ibn al-Musayyab, he said: We memorized from thirty of the companions of the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, that he said: Whoever frees his share in a slave, he guarantees the remainder."
